[839.693216, "o", "fused cfg (128, 512, 32, 8, 8, 3): failed out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262144, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block s\r\nBEST fused (256, 128, 32, 8, 8, 3) 2.773947448730469\r\nrobustness fused: fails=0/20 maxerr=4.816e-05\r\n"]
